meta {
  name: 04 Containers
  type: http
  seq: 4
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/containers?pageNo=0&pageSize=30
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  pageNo: 0
  pageSize: 30
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

docs {
  Used by the integration in the config flow when a meter number is entered
  (`async_get_containers`): finds the container whose `meterSerialNumbers` contains it.
  Paged via `pageNo`/`pageSize`, `totalCount` gives the total. Also called at most
  once per hour while the *Meter connection* diagnostic sensor is enabled, which
  reads `offline` of the configured container (SPEC REQ-25).

  Per container: `id`, `meterSerialNumbers`, `measurementInterval` (ms),
  `lastMeasurementTime`, `offline`. `description` and `address` contain personal data.
}
